{
  "id": "E164",
  "title": "I Want a Hot Latte",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2017-11-03",
  "synopsis": "How do you order coffee and cake at a café?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/567/9fd615edb2a09d72ffef58532a0db445457ce8a7.mp3?1509469266",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "我要一杯热拿铁 \n\n安妮：你好，我要一杯热拿铁，加糖和奶油。\n服务员：您要大杯、中杯还是小杯？\n安妮：我要大杯。\n服务员：好的，您还要什么？\n安妮：我还要一块蛋糕。你们有什么蛋糕？\n服务员：我们有巧克力蛋糕、芝士蛋糕和水果蛋糕。\n安妮：我要一块巧克力蛋糕。一共多少钱？\n服务员：五十二块。",
    "traditional": "我要一杯熱拿鐵 \n\n安妮：你好，我要一杯熱拿鐵，加糖和奶油。\n服務員：您要大杯、中杯還是小杯？\n安妮：我要大杯。\n服務員：好的，您還要什麼？\n安妮：我還要一塊蛋糕。你們有什麼蛋糕？\n服務員：我們有巧克力蛋糕、芝士蛋糕和水果蛋糕。\n安妮：我要一塊巧克力蛋糕。一共多少錢？\n服務員：五十二塊。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I Want a Cup of Hot Latte"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "安妮：你好，我要一杯热拿铁，加糖和奶油。",
      "traditional": "安妮：你好，我要一杯熱拿鐵，加糖和奶油。",
      "pinyin": "ān nī nǐ hǎo wǒ yào yì bēi rè ná tiě jiā táng hé nǎi yóu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: Hi, I want a hot latte, with sugar and cream."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "服务员：您要大杯、中杯还是小杯？",
      "traditional": "服務員：您要大杯、中杯還是小杯？",
      "pinyin": "fú wù yuán nín yào dà bēi zhōng bēi hái shi xiǎo bēi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Waiter: Do you want large, medium or small?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "安妮：我要大杯。",
      "traditional": "安妮：我要大杯。",
      "pinyin": "ān nī wǒ yào dà bēi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: Large, please."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "服务员：好的，您还要什么？",
      "traditional": "服務員：好的，您還要什麼？",
      "pinyin": "fú wù yuán hǎo de nín hái yào shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Waiter: Ok, would you like something else?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "安妮：我还要一块蛋糕。你们有什么蛋糕？",
      "traditional": "安妮：我還要一塊蛋糕。你們有什麼蛋糕？",
      "pinyin": "ān nī wǒ hái yào yí kuài dàn gāo nǐ men yǒu shén me dàn gāo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: I want a piece of cake. What kind of cake do you have here?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "服务员：我们有巧克力蛋糕、芝士蛋糕和水果蛋糕。",
      "traditional": "服務員：我們有巧克力蛋糕、芝士蛋糕和水果蛋糕。",
      "pinyin": "fú wù yuán wǒ men yǒu qiǎo kè lì dàn gāo zhī shì dàn gāo hé shuǐ guǒ dàn gāo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Waiter: We have chocolate cake, cheesecake and fruit cake."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "安妮：我要一块巧克力蛋糕。一共多少钱？",
      "traditional": "安妮：我要一塊巧克力蛋糕。一共多少錢？",
      "pinyin": "ān nī wǒ yào yí kuài qiǎo kè lì dàn gāo yí gòng duō shao qián",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: I want a piece of chocolate cake. How much is it in total?"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "服务员：五十二块。",
      "traditional": "服務員：五十二塊。",
      "pinyin": "fú wù yuán wǔ shí èr kuài",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Waiter: 52 yuan."
    }
  ],
